# Easy Chart evaluation corpus. Harvested (transcript, gold note) pairs are PHI: they come from real
# visits in a live environment and must never be committed. These rules are in place BEFORE the first
# harvest, deliberately — adding them afterwards is how PHI reaches a git history.
# The twenty SYNTHETIC dictations in tools/easy-chart-eval/cases/ are written-for-purpose teaching
# cases with no identifiers, and are committed on purpose.
